<title>USA: FSA announces secondary insurance capacity.</title>
<headline>FSA announces secondary insurance capacity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance has secondary insurance capacity for:</p>
<p>--N.Y.S. Dorm (Mental Health Facilities)</p>
<p>--N.Y.S. Medical Care (Mental Health Facilities)</p>
<p>Insurance is available on maturities 2007 and longer.</p>
<p>--Puerto Rico Electric Power Authority</p>
<p>Insurance is available on maturities 2007 and longer.</p>
<p>There is no par limit per firm on the above.</p>
<p>For futher details contact Tom Byrne, Greg Haggerty, or Alan Steinfeld at 212-826-0601.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
